<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower Tuesday in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 557.79, off 1.89.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 284 to 223.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.05.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 18,043,630, compared with 13,629,670 Friday.</p>
<p>	     (Prices official as of 1645 EDT/2045 GMT)</p>
